     The 4.4BSD extension of accepting arguments outside of the range of the
     _u_n_s_i_g_n_e_d _c_h_a_r type in locales with large character sets is considered ob‐
     solete and may not be supported in future releases.  The iisswwbbllaannkk() or
     iisswwbbllaannkk__ll() function should be used instead.

